ution.md`, incrementing the\nversion per semantic versioning (MAJOR: principle removal or redefinition;\nMINOR: new principle or materially expanded guidance; PATCH: wording or\nclarification), updating `LAST_AMENDED_DATE`, and noting the change in a\nSync Impact Report until committed. Compliance MUST be reviewed at each\nphase boundary: preserved-API checks, test evidence, and documented\nassumptions. Deferred non-governance intents MUST be listed as Next\nActions with the appropriate follow-up Spec Kit command (e.g.,\n`$speckit-specify`) rather than executed here.\n\n**Version**: 1.0.0 | **Ratified**: 2026-10-17 | **Last Amended**: 2026-10-17\nEOF\necho written; wc -l /testbed/.specify/memory/constitution.md", "exit_code": 0, "stderr": "", "stdout": "written\n91 /testbed/.specify/memory/constitution.md\n"}